      "name": "validate",
      "line_number": 123,
      "docstring": "Validate basic DAG invariants:\n\n    \u2022 Node keys must match node.name.\n    \u2022 All dependencies and fallback targets must exist.\n    \u2022 Graph must be acyclic.",
